Moonchild tells you: Glad to see them back: they were fun to play.

Gwrox tells you: i think it is good for nanny because it seems to have revived
      alot of people. ive actually seen *gasp* cost playing again
      but personally i think its a boring guild and was reopened
      because it seems to take very little work
      but overall, im glad it opened, i just wont be playing it

Atreyu tells you: Man, I know nothing about that guild or what it's supposed to
      do :/   But new guilds is nice

Klor tells you: you should ask a more active player...i don't know
