Backstab replies to you: I think it's great to see old code being revamped and
      being brought back to the mud. When can I expect kittens back? :)

Yellow replies to you: First of all, the opening of prophets is the reason I
      was born ;)
      I think it's a great event, as Nanny seemed pretty quiet lately.
      To me at least, being that this char needed (real)
      playing, the prophets opening was a great way to get back into the game,
      and ironically enough, I even started playing my other old chars! But
      that's me.

Polar tells you: I think its great, i can create another character!

Noble tells you: I think its kind of a fun guild and its sparking new
      characters which is good.

Astrodeath tells you: I think it's great. The Prophets have nostalgic value
