Gemfibrozil tells you: I think it is fun having something new to learn about.

Jeremiah tells you: I think it sets a good trend. That the dead and buried does
      not always stay dead and buried. While not everything is worth
      reviving, this shows that it can be done and that it is well received.
      The fact the guild has some interesting powers not seen
      elsewhere doesn't hurt either. Anything that brings more to the mix
      that is Nanny is good. And that IS a fact :)

Oak tells you: I never saw it coming -- because i'm not a prophet. HA!
      I still think it should be a commerce based guild called
      Profits.
      "You wear the amulet of Mad Bling$"
      now, at least, i can run around only _claiming_ to be a prophet.
      False prophets are cool. And apparently, so are false profits.

Yberiel tells you: Answer: I think its great that the guild has opened again. 
      I dont know anything about the guild yet, I was not around when it was
      open last time, and I have not tried it out yet, but I think it is
      great because it makes me feel, and I am sure others too, that
      something's happening around here. And that is always refreshing.

Beldin tells you: Beldin is carrying: A rubber stamp (wielded).

Kefka replies to you: I think it was a good thing, it gave people a more PK
