Mouser tells you: a Prophet's Guild opened?

Galathien tells you: Well, I am very curious about it myself, already made a
      prophet character. Havent had much time to play it so far, but I
      will! :) I loved the titles, loved the concept.
      Imo, new guilds, new clubs is always a good thing which
      might make... Actually, already made old folks more active :)

Rotten tells you: I'm not familiar with the guild actually - although I am told
