Skuggfaxe tells you: Prophets Guild... whats that?

Frost replies to you: Prophets are just another reason for people to make 
      new characters and compete to be the best at something. I disagree 
      with the guild and the motion to reopen it.
      Who wants another one power guild?
      A virtually useless guild, for only those who have a lot of time 
      to waste. (Even more then normal mudders)

Narya replies to you: If that's the actual Times question ... well, not much,
      as I don't play any more. :) I'm glad to see another guild open for the
      mortals, though, and glad that an old popular guild is being reopened.

Water replies to you: Excellent! Why? Because I can join it again to find out
      why I liked it in the first place, ten years ago :)

Reiko replies to you: It can only be good, I guess. The guild has an
      interesting feeling.
      I don't think I've progressed enough within the guild to
      say anything interesting about how it plays, though.

Barbarella tells you: I was a Prophet before becoming a wizard, and I foresaw
      this day in a dream.  Overall, I'd say it's very Depressing ;)

Ashes tells you: Oh, don't even get my started with that.
      Never have and never will like that guild. Especially now that it has 
      been recoded. Waste of code. Get a good guild back into the game!
      Hunters, Kitties..you know, a fun guild :)
      I mean, what are your thoughts? Surely, this can't be that great for 
      the game. In any case, my thoughts are that it was not a beneficial
      move to add another seemingly useless guild, like Masters.
      A thought would be to, remove Masters and Prophets and never speak 
      of them again.
      The only good thing about Prophets is that if one decided to idle at 
      green, beggars can just sit there and leech. Saving others from having 
      to donate to them. I disagree with the decision to recode them.

      It has 1 attacking power, some useless ways of donating money 
      because you are generous? a day where your powers work twice as well, 
      an interesting choice in the final title you achieve.. meteorologist.
      I figured they would have changed that at least. Just never did and 
      still doesn't strike me as a final title for a guild. More of a 
      mid-title. I mean, I understand the basis of it, but I still think 
      they could have added a new title, or something.

      Surely the other powers they have aren't very needed. That reading 
      of the fortune, more of a spam club thing, then a guild power. But, 
      all the more power to those who want to play that guild. At least 
      it's not Masters. ;) Well, I mean, I could go on and on about how much 
      of a waste it was to recode, but the truth is, it is in the game now 
      and no point in removing it now.

      I just really think when the demand for Hunters was so high, they 
      should have listened and recoded it, not Prophets.


